Package: fbrglm
Title: Formula-Based Regularized Generalized Linear Models
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Koki",
           family = "Tsuyuzaki",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "koki.tsuyuzaki@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a formula-based interface for regularized generalized
    linear models, wrapping 'glmnet' so it can be used with a feel close to
    base R's 'glm()'. Handles formula/data input, automatic factor
    encoding, complete-case filtering, and a single 'lambda' selector
    covering 'cv.min', 'cv.1se', and a fixed user-specified value.
    Accepts character family strings (gaussian, binomial, poisson, cox,
    multinomial, mgaussian) and any GLM family object the underlying
    'glmnet' itself accepts, including 'Gamma' and fixed-theta negative
    binomial via 'MASS::negative.binomial'.
URL: https://github.com/dsc-chiba-u/fbrglm
